Z||000007||SKIDMARK||10-18-2001||09:19 AM||||I don't get it! In all my junkyard shopping I have never come a cross a 120mph speedo in a Fiero. Everyone seems to have one but me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> My '86 SE unfortunately has an 85mph version.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>White '85 4cyl coupe<BR>Black '86 v-6 SE<BR>'81 CB900F Super Sport||||reg||5
